    prompt: 'The seller success team wants to measure buyer reach — how many distinct buyers each seller has transacted with. A junior analyst used COUNT(*) per seller but the lead flagged it as counting transactions, not buyers. Write the correct query returning seller_id and unique_buyers, ordered by unique_buyers descending.',
