    prompt: 'The analytics team\'s buyer activation metric has been in the CMO\'s weekly deck for a month. It currently shows 28. A new analyst joining the team flagged that 28 buyers out of 15 registered users is mathematically impossible. Find the bug and write the corrected query.',
