    brokenOutputNote: 'Returns projected_6mo_users = 23. The formula applies 15% × 6 months additively (1 + 0.90 = 1.90×), instead of compounding 15% monthly for 6 months (1.15^6 = 2.313×). The linear model underestimates the correct projection by 5 users — a 17% gap that widens dramatically at higher growth rates or longer horizons.',
