    brokenQuery: 'SELECT ROUND(\n  COUNT(CASE WHEN ended_at >= \'2024-01-01\' AND ended_at < \'2024-04-01\' THEN 1 END) * 1.0 /\n  NULLIF(COUNT(CASE WHEN status = \'active\' THEN 1 END), 0)\n, 3) AS q1_churn_rate\nFROM subscriptions',
    brokenOutputNote: 'Returns 0.250 (25.0%). The denominator uses current active subscriber count (12 subscriptions with status=\'active\') — which excludes the very subscribers who churned in Q1. The correct denominator is the count active at the START of Q1 (before any churn or additions). Using the smaller end-of-period base artificially inflates the churn rate.',
