    prompt: 'Finance wants to know how much delivered revenue came through each payment mode. The query below runs without error — but the numbers look completely off. Find the two bugs.',
    brokenQuery: 'SELECT payment_mode, COUNT(*) AS total_revenue\nFROM orders\nGROUP BY payment_mode\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC',
    brokenOutputNote: 'Returns order counts per payment mode (UPI: 13, card: 8, COD: 4) instead of delivered revenue. Two bugs: COUNT(*) instead of SUM(total_amount), and no filter on status = \'delivered\' — includes 4 cancelled orders.',
